            {
              "textRaw": "archive.getZipFile()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "getZipFile",
              "desc": "<p>返回底层 Zip4j <code>ZipFile</code>，供高级互操作使用。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let archive = $zip.open(&#39;./bundle.zip&#39;, { password: &#39;secret&#39; });\narchive.addFiles([&#39;./a.txt&#39;, &#39;./b.txt&#39;]);\n\nconsole.log(archive.getFileHeaders().length);\nconsole.log(archive.isEncrypted());\n</code></pre>\n",
